1
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:06,610
(Amy:)This is an easy one.
You love this guy.

2
00:00:06,607 --> 00:00:08,177
(Scene:)Me.

3
00:00:09,477 --> 00:00:12,947
(Amy:)Come on, he's an
underappreciated genius.

4
00:00:12,947 --> 00:00:15,317
(Sheldon:)Still think it's me.

5
00:00:15,316 --> 00:00:16,946
(Amy:)It's not you.

6
00:00:16,951 --> 00:00:19,681
(Amy:)Now think, there's
a car named after him.

7
00:00:19,687 --> 00:00:21,117
(Sheldon:)Of course there is.

8
00:00:21,122 --> 00:00:22,922
(Sheldon:)The Mini Cooper,
'cause it's me.

9
00:00:25,159 --> 00:00:26,989
How about this:

10
00:00:26,994 --> 00:00:29,164
(Amy:)he's a poor man's
Sheldon Cooper.

11
00:00:29,163 --> 00:00:30,763
(Sheldon:)Oh, Tesla.

12
00:00:31,799 --> 00:00:32,869
(Amy:)Hi.
Hey!

13
00:00:32,867 --> 00:00:34,297
How'd it go?
Hello.
Oh, not fun.

14
00:00:34,301 --> 00:00:37,501
(Leonard:)The doctor shoved a camera
up into my sinuses.

15
00:00:37,505 --> 00:00:39,635
(Penny:)Yeah, I watched. It was like
the scary boat tunnel

16
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:41,540
in Willy Wonka.

17
00:00:42,977 --> 00:00:45,147
(Amy:)Did they figure out
what's wrong?
Yeah.

18
00:00:45,146 --> 00:00:46,146
(Leonard:)It's a deviated septum.

19
00:00:46,147 --> 00:00:47,017
(Leonard:)The surgery
to correct it is simple.

20
00:00:47,014 --> 00:00:48,314
(Leonard:)He's gonna do it next week.

21
00:00:48,315 --> 00:00:50,185
(Sheldon:)Why would you have surgery?

22
00:00:50,184 --> 00:00:51,984
(Leonard:)Because I can't breathe.

23
00:00:51,986 --> 00:00:54,556
(Leonard:)I snore, I get sinus
infections...

24
00:00:54,555 --> 00:00:56,985
(Penny:)Yeah, back off,
he's all mine.

25
00:00:56,991 --> 00:00:59,221
(Sheldon:)But you don't have
a life-threatening condition.

26
00:00:59,226 --> 00:01:01,056
(Sheldon:)Why would you
take the risk of surgery?

